# `implicit` marks a `def` or an `=` binding of one name.
#
# An implicit argument is resolved by name and by type, so there has to
# be a name to find (PYKING.md, "Implicits").
#
# This program is expected to FAIL parsing. Its `.ast.out` holds the
# error message, not a program's output.

implicit var count = 0

print(count)
